{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19199","headline":"吴方之见示独酌小醉首篇乐天续有詶答皆含戏谑极至风流两篇之中竝蒙见属辄呈滥吹益美来章 · 刘禹锡","name":"吴方之见示独酌小醉首篇乐天续有詶答皆含戏谑极至风流两篇之中竝蒙见属辄呈滥吹益美来章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲门共寂任张罗，静室同虚养太和。\n尘世欢娱开意少，醉乡风景独游多。\n散金疏傅寻常乐，枕麴刘生取次歌。\n计会雪中争挈榼，鹿裘鹤氅递相过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}